                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Is blockchain worth investing in for my business?</h3>
                                        <p>For most: no significant investment. Real use cases are narrow — supply chain provenance for high-value goods, tokenised assets in regulated environments, cross-border corporate payments.</p>
                                        <h3>Is UAE the best jurisdiction for a Web3 company?</h3>
                                        <p>One of the best. VARA framework is clear, government-supportive, tax-favourable. Only Singapore and select Swiss cantons compete on regulatory clarity.</p>
                                        <h3>Public or private blockchain?</h3>
                                        <p>Public for consumer applications + tokenised RWAs. Private for enterprise consortium use cases (supply chain, trade finance).</p>
                                        <h3>Are NFTs still relevant for enterprise?</h3>
                                        <p>For select loyalty / membership use cases, yes (Starbucks pattern). For most enterprises, no — hype-cycle asset.</p>
